      "title": "Approach and Circuit Notes",
      "items": [
        {
          "type": "note",
          "text": "The Yak C11 is typically difficult to slow down and it takes a while to get the airspeed low enough to meet the gear and flap limits of 163 and 135 knots respectively.",
